{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04861","headline":"奉和岳州山城 · 张垍","name":"奉和岳州山城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡馆临清赏，开扃坐白云。\n讼虚棠户曙，观静竹檐曛。\n悬榻迎宾下，趋庭学礼闻。\n风传琴上意，遥向日华纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张垍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}